OL,3,GNEWSAInvasive mosquito species found
OL,4,Abreeding in London
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn invasive mosquito species known to
OL,7,Fspread diseases such as the dengue,
OL,8,Fchikungunya and Zika viruses has been
OL,9,Ffound breeding in some east London
OL,10,Fhomes.
OL,12,FThe Aedes aegypti insects have been
OL,13,Fdetected in the UK before now, but this
OL,14,Fis the first time they have been
OL,15,Fdiscovered reproducing.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,325,320,200,140,0,100
