OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F324A1788443777
OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAInvasive mosquito species found
OL,4,Abreeding in London
OL,5,
OL,6,FThey are usually found in countries
OL,7,Fwith tropical and subtropical climates
OL,8,Fand it is thought the breed was
OL,9,Fimported accidentally in baggage, in
OL,10,Fvehicles or with plants. Measures are
OL,11,Fnow in place to destroy the larvae, and
OL,12,Fsurveillance and trapping have been
OL,13,Fstepped up.
OL,15,FThe UK Health Security Agency (UKHSA)
OL,16,Fsaid the risk to the public was low and
OL,17,Fthere was no evidence of humans being
OL,18,Finfected by these insects.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
